+Every PC write empties the buffer, as mGBA's `GBASetActiveRegion` does
+(`lastPrefetchedPc = 0`, called by `ARMWritePC` on every branch, exception
+entry and return): the interpreter calls `Bus::prefetch_reset` after any
+instruction that wrote R15, generated code clears `last_prefetched_pc` after
